00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.956
- And where has this
taken you as an adult?

00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:32.690
- It took me to prison.
Took me to reform school.

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:36.223
Took me to group homes,
family treatment programs.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.630
It kept me institutionalized until

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:43.193
I was about 25 years of age.

00:06:44.431 --> 00:06:47.110
I kept me, you know,
locked up in mental wards

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:51.003
