00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:34.793
heavily medicated. You know, sedated.

00:07:36.107 --> 00:07:37.470
And strapped down, and...

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:43.160
I don't know, it was pretty
weird how things worked out.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.530
Because no child asks for that

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:46.460
kind of stuff, you know what I mean?

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:48.373
All I was trying to do was, um,

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:51.720
make a fucked up situation a little

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:54.220
