You know what I mean?

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.993
I just couldn't do that no more.

00:08:08.175 --> 00:08:11.027
Just be tooken advantage of, be told

00:08:11.027 --> 00:08:14.050
"Sit over here", or "Be quiet".

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:16.890
And it got to the point
that I became so defiant

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.440
with everything that I became

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:20.203
my worst enemy, you know?

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.173
You know, then I got into the drug scene.

00:08:25.263 --> 00:08:27.513
And that's when things
really really got bad.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.019
You know?

00:08:30.019 --> 00:08:31.762
- What drugs were you using?

00:08:31.762 --> 00:08:33.523
- Back then we used to do this thing

00:08:33.523 --> 00:08:38.350
called (unclear), we used
to pop pills in my day.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:41.150
Then we used to do this
thing called "lovely".

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:43.630
It was this weed, almost like "Sherman",

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:46.920
but it was weed, we smoked that.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.480
And then we would do the thing

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.330
that's called "crank". But it was

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.440
a recreational thing back in my day,

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:57.120
'cause the world was different then.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.460
You know, like on Fridays and

00:08:58.460 --> 00:09:00.650
Saturdays and Sundays, you know,

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.680
you run the streets
after a hard day's work

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.610
of doing what you're doing, And you do

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.960
a little "chooch", you do a little party,

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:08.030
