and stuff like that.

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.960
And then, when Monday got back around,

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:13.723
life became back to normal, you know?

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:19.473
It didn't become, um, a daily thing until,

00:09:20.791 --> 00:09:24.540
I'd say around the '90s,
when it was a thing

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.057
that you really knew what
addiction was, know what I mean.

00:09:27.057 --> 00:09:29.050
'Cause now people are consuming

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:32.460
this stuff every day. And it's a need now.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.260
So it wasn't just a party favor.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.130
Just to have a nice time at the club

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.350
or to dance or, you know what I mean,

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.760
to go out and turn some tricks and stuff.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.840
You know, and, with that being said,

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:48.720
