00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:50.670
you right back to where you started.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.440
So the same thing that
was happening to you

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.640
when you was young, you
learned how to get out of it.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:58.380
When you became addicted, you start

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:00.930
