00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:03.161
that these people were doing to you,

00:10:03.161 --> 00:10:04.840
or life was doing to you.
You know what I mean?

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:08.520
So it's strange how things work.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:10.460
It's really strange. I've always...

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.490
That was just funny to me. That's why

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:17.470
I always said, you know,
I became my worst enemy.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.850
You know, because most of the things

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:23.010
I went through in the
last ten, fifteen years

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.810
