00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:30.600
I did it to myself.
And I did it eyes open.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:33.733
And didn't give a fuck. You know.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:36.410
I've been through all that, you know,

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:38.330
